                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "The Virgin Islands' remote geography makes our rural hospitals literal lifelines. \n\nWhen someone suffers a heart attack on St. John or faces a medical emergency on St. Croix, these facilities aren't just convenient options\u2014they're the difference between life and death. \n\nI continue to urge my colleagues to remember that healthcare equity means ensuring that zip code\u2014or in the Virgin Islands\u2019 case, which island you call home\u2014doesn't determine whether you live or die.\n\n#HandsoffMedicaid",
